01:23:24.310 --> 01:23:27.120
You don't have to sound so sad about it.

01:23:27.120 --> 01:23:30.000
Zelos, the Dragon Race's enemy during

01:23:30.000 --> 01:23:33.740
The War of the Monsters Fall, the one who nearly destroyed my people.

01:23:34.160 --> 01:23:35.860
A demon among demons.

01:23:36.510 --> 01:23:38.990
Oh, am I really that bad?

01:23:39.330 --> 01:23:41.110
Look, I found Miss Lina first.

01:23:41.230 --> 01:23:43.950
I don't know what you're planning, but stop interfering.

01:23:44.190 --> 01:23:45.430
Stay out of our way.

01:23:45.830 --> 01:23:47.350
I'm not getting in your way.

01:23:48.060 --> 01:23:49.520
Oh, I get it.

01:23:49.740 --> 01:23:52.320
It's okay for you to get Lina out here on a pretext,

01:23:52.480 --> 01:23:54.640
but it's horrible if I did it first.

01:23:54.960 --> 01:23:59.920
Even if I did use a pretext, I'm trying to save the world from a horrible threat.

01:24:00.250 --> 01:24:03.730
- It isn't like the selfish pretext a monster would use.

01:24:03.730 --> 01:24:05.760
- A pretext is a pretext.

01:24:05.760 --> 01:24:09.950
- Do you get the feeling that those two

01:24:09.950 --> 01:24:11.710
really don't like each other?

01:24:11.710 --> 01:24:13.770
- Well, one's a monster and the other serves the gods

01:24:13.770 --> 01:24:15.690
as a priestess of the Fire Dragon King.

01:24:15.690 --> 01:24:18.890
- A grudge that's gone on since the War of the Monsters Fall.

01:24:18.890 --> 01:24:21.970
- Look, look, anyway, can we all calm down here?

01:24:21.970 --> 01:24:24.660
Let's just sort out what we've learned so far.

01:24:24.660 --> 01:24:27.400
Zelos, for once, I want you to tell us

01:24:27.400 --> 01:24:30.000
everything you know in detail.

01:24:30.030 --> 01:24:38.440
as i know the enemy has three objectives three first as you already know your death to avenge

01:24:38.440 --> 01:24:47.290
gov right he has no reason to hate us the next one is gorun nova which gallery possesses the sword

01:24:47.290 --> 01:24:52.970
of light hold on a second what do you mean gorun nova is that your people's dialect

01:24:54.450 --> 01:25:00.000
oh no you see gorun nova is the proper name for it from ancient times

01:25:00.120 --> 01:25:05.120
Now hold on here. This has been passed down through my family. In other words, it's mine!

01:25:05.120 --> 01:25:07.040
That's not the problem here!

01:25:07.040 --> 01:25:10.960
Oh, never mind. I recognize your ownership of it.

01:25:10.960 --> 01:25:12.960
While it's to my advantage, at least.

01:25:12.960 --> 01:25:14.940
What are you mumbling about?

01:25:14.940 --> 01:25:16.940
And what's his last objective?

01:25:16.940 --> 01:25:22.940
It seems he's looking for a weapon, similar to the Sword of Light, but even more powerful.

01:25:22.940 --> 01:25:30.000
Now that you mention it, remember those greedy people we saw when we arrived? They seem...

01:25:30.120 --> 01:25:32.020
to be looking for something. You think

01:25:32.020 --> 01:25:33.560
they were involved in this too?

01:25:33.920 --> 01:25:35.600
Come on. That's silly.

01:25:35.880 --> 01:25:38.040
Besides, if it was true and they had a weapon

01:25:38.040 --> 01:25:40.000
as strong as the Sword of Light, they wouldn't

01:25:40.000 --> 01:25:41.940
have run away like that. True, but

01:25:41.940 --> 01:25:43.960
it is a fact that they're in a frenzy to

01:25:43.960 --> 01:25:45.970
find the other weapon. Currently,

01:25:46.210 --> 01:25:47.850
their eyes are on the Holy Sword

01:25:47.850 --> 01:25:49.450
held by the Sand People.

01:25:49.750 --> 01:25:51.410
The Holy Sword of the Sand People?

01:25:52.030 --> 01:25:54.080
Huh. Wait, how did you know

01:25:54.080 --> 01:25:55.960
that much? Before I ran

01:25:55.960 --> 01:25:57.930
into you all, I saw them attack a

01:25:57.930 --> 01:26:00.000
Sand People village. I've seen how

01:26:00.000 --> 01:26:18.310
serious they are so what's happening in the village now see for yourself well if volgov himself isn't

01:26:18.310 --> 01:26:29.860
there it doesn't concern me does it you know you sure would make a great politician zelos well anyway

01:26:30.160 --> 01:26:35.490
you're going exactly and i'll take the sand people's treasure for myself

01:26:35.490 --> 01:26:46.350
what hey wait for me come on wait for me so tell me philia how's the fire dragon king these days

01:26:46.350 --> 01:26:56.050
lying you creep that hurts

01:27:00.410 --> 01:27:00.970
Okay.

01:27:04.930 --> 01:27:18.320
Do it.

01:27:18.580 --> 01:27:20.000
Don't blame me for what happens.

01:27:20.420 --> 01:27:21.000
Ahhhh!

01:28:02.010 --> 01:28:14.190
Hmph.

01:28:14.190 --> 01:28:16.430
Protector I've heard so much about.

01:28:16.430 --> 01:28:18.750
Yeah, I suppose you could call me that?

01:28:18.750 --> 01:28:20.330
What's that weird weapon he has?

01:28:20.330 --> 01:28:20.850
Heh.

01:28:20.850 --> 01:28:23.040
Would you prefer a closer look?

01:28:23.040 --> 01:28:26.520
That's impossible! That weapon! It's just like the Sword of Light!

01:28:26.520 --> 01:28:27.710
Gowry!

01:28:27.710 --> 01:28:30.000
There's only one Sword of Light in this world!

01:28:31.400 --> 01:28:33.400
and it belongs to my family.

01:28:33.400 --> 01:28:39.070
In that case, care to test it?

01:28:41.960 --> 01:28:46.950
We'll have to finish it off.

01:28:46.950 --> 01:28:51.660
I warned him, I warned him!

01:28:51.660 --> 01:28:53.910
What do you mean?

01:28:53.910 --> 01:28:54.910
It's his fault.

01:28:54.910 --> 01:28:58.760
It's his fault for making me summon that monster.

01:28:58.760 --> 01:28:59.700
What? Then...

01:29:00.280 --> 01:29:01.390
I see.

01:29:01.390 --> 01:29:02.330
Mr. Zellos!

01:29:02.330 --> 01:29:07.530
It seems the Sand People's Holy Sword was simply a key for keeping that monster sealed.

01:29:07.530 --> 01:29:09.130
Do something, please!

01:29:09.130 --> 01:29:13.830
Oh, no. If I were to do something, Lord Beastmaster would be very angry with me.

01:29:13.830 --> 01:29:15.590
Typically useless.

01:29:17.770 --> 01:29:20.450
Look, I don't know what's going on here!

01:29:20.450 --> 01:29:21.860
Let's get out of here!

01:29:21.860 --> 01:29:22.740
Right!

01:29:22.740 --> 01:29:24.710
Come back!

01:29:26.000 --> 01:29:28.160
Ms. Filia!

01:29:28.160 --> 01:29:30.000
You won't be taking off on me!

01:29:30.000 --> 01:29:36.820
This time

01:29:36.820 --> 01:29:39.770
Well, are you satisfied now?

01:29:39.770 --> 01:29:43.770
You're pretty tough, so I guess this means you've finally found what you've been looking for

01:29:43.770 --> 01:29:45.770
One of them at least

01:29:45.770 --> 01:29:47.820
One of them? You mean there are others?

01:29:47.820 --> 01:29:49.990
Then let's stop playing around

01:29:49.990 --> 01:29:53.060
I'm game, if you are

01:29:53.060 --> 01:29:57.940
We have to get this sword back where it belongs, alright?

01:29:57.940 --> 01:30:00.000
Alright, leave it to me!

01:30:00.160 --> 01:30:01.260
Where does it belong?

01:30:01.260 --> 01:30:03.960
Inside that cave over there, I believe.

01:30:03.960 --> 01:30:08.300
Oh, over there?

01:30:08.300 --> 01:30:10.250
Amelia, how much do you weigh?

01:30:10.250 --> 01:30:13.660
I was asking you seriously.

01:30:15.080 --> 01:30:17.600
Alright.

01:30:17.600 --> 01:30:19.260
Direction, 30 degrees.

01:30:19.260 --> 01:30:20.760
Firing angle, 20.

01:30:20.760 --> 01:30:22.730
Mr. Zelgoth!

01:30:22.730 --> 01:30:25.060
Relax, Amelia. Let's get going.

01:30:25.060 --> 01:30:26.790
Bomb D...

01:30:26.790 --> 01:30:27.910
Win!

01:30:48.840 --> 01:30:51.560
hope it worked. Hey, where's Lena?

01:30:53.800 --> 01:30:58.180
What's the matter? Do you doubt

01:30:58.180 --> 01:31:00.000
the power of a weapon? No!

01:31:00.860 --> 01:31:01.360
Provoke you!

01:31:01.360 --> 01:31:02.860
I'm already provoked!

01:31:03.510 --> 01:31:06.740
AHHHHH!

01:31:10.810 --> 01:31:12.800
What? What the?

01:31:12.800 --> 01:31:18.710
What is this?!

01:31:18.710 --> 01:31:21.640
That's...

01:31:21.640 --> 01:31:23.750
WHAT'S HAPPENING?!

01:31:46.000 --> 01:31:54.590
I retreat why why retreat when I'm so close to finishing them off I said

01:31:55.430 --> 01:31:57.560
retreat

01:32:00.670 --> 01:32:02.370
YOU'RE NOT GONNA GET OFF THAT EAGLE!

01:32:02.370 --> 01:32:03.670
YOU'RE NOT GETTING AWAY!

01:32:03.670 --> 01:32:12.220
RAH TOOL!

01:32:12.220 --> 01:32:24.700
Magic wasn't strong enough.

01:32:24.700 --> 01:32:25.700
Not true.

01:32:25.700 --> 01:32:26.700
Huh?

01:32:26.700 --> 01:32:28.650
It's not that it isn't strong enough.

01:32:28.650 --> 01:32:30.000
It's meaningless.

01:32:30.000 --> 01:32:33.500
to even try to use magic on one of his kind.

01:32:33.500 --> 01:32:37.100
What is he, anyway?

01:32:37.100 --> 01:32:46.280
Damn you, Lena Inverse. Mark my words: I will kill you.

01:32:46.280 --> 01:32:52.050
Man, who are these guys?

01:32:52.050 --> 01:32:56.220
Well, it looks like another major battle is underway.

01:32:56.220 --> 01:32:57.220
Is that...?

01:32:57.220 --> 01:33:00.000
Is he the one who will fill the world with darkness?

01:33:00.720 --> 01:33:01.840
Apparently so.

01:33:02.200 --> 01:33:04.140
It's just as your prophecy warned.

01:33:05.480 --> 01:33:07.300
The threat to the world.

01:34:06.780 --> 01:34:07.560
Aim for it

01:34:34.640 --> 01:34:43.440
the temple air dragon king philia xellos what is the problem with you two next time a wild rumor

01:34:43.440 --> 01:34:48.500
you can't have smoke without fire you better watch or i'll really cause some trouble
